Mounting every wizard step and panel...
[HookForge] Clerk is not configured, running in no-auth mode.
  Sign-in/sign-up are disabled and all data is stored under the shared
  "anonymous" user.

  To enable authentication, set REACT_APP_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY at BUILD
  time (CRA inlines it into the bundle):
    • Local:  add it to frontend/.env then restart/rebuild
    • Docker: pass --build-arg REACT_APP_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_...
    • Render: add it as an Environment Variable, then redeploy

  Get the key from https://dashboard.clerk.com -> API Keys.
